  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow></math><br />Now LHS <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Integers in this interval are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence, there are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;integers for which the equation has real solutions</p>",
